                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Received through the consul-general at
                        Shanghai, August 5, 1900.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pekin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-07-21"><hi rendition="#italic">July 21,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>All well. No fighting since 16th by agreement. Enough provisions; little
                    ammunition. Hope for speedy relief.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Conger.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
